          "quote": "他如果说不出来话，让他点头或摇头回答就可以"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 had a serious omission. Despite visible weakness and reduced speech, the doctor did not adequately assess or actionize breathing difficulty, worsening consciousness, pallor/cold sweat, abdominal worsening, or soaking/spurting bleeding with instructions to call EMS/alert staff if present.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
