          "explanation": "The doctor converted urgency into an immediate ED/EMS pathway.",
          "quote": "**立即拨打120或就近送急诊，不要等待。**"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00016",
          "explanation": "The doctor attempted to clarify whether transport was already underway.",
          "quote": "你们现在有车在送还是等救护车？"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 was met: the response specified immediate 120 or emergency department transfer and sought the current transport mode, with a stated plan to register emergency transfer information.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
