      "explanation": "RC5 had a serious omission. The doctor appropriately instructed no food or drink, but did not warn against self-administering or adding oral painkillers, aspirin/NSAIDs, sedatives, alcohol, or other bleeding-risk medications during transfer.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
